# Validation & testing (Blank Panel)

## Routine checks

```bash
bun run verify
```

Runs: **`templ generate`** → **`build:css`** → **`lint:ui8px`** → **`go test ./...`**

Also run after markup/JS hook changes:

```bash
bun run validate:aria
```

(`ui8px validate aria internal/views internal/ui --manifest web/static/js/manifest.json`)

## Go render tests

Add **`Test*_wireframeRenders`** in `internal/views` for critical surfaces (cabinet shell, login) so layout/mobile sheet/theme/locale markup regress without a browser. See `wireframe_render_test.go`.

## CSS validator

Deferred until brand polish; Tailwind output is not a strict W3C CSS gate in the wireframe phase.

## Coordination

- **`blank-atomic-ui8px.mdc`** — lint scope, no raw tags, no custom CSS classes
- **`blank-aria.mdc`** — manifest + `data-ui8kit` contract
- **`blank-fixtures-data.mdc`** — sensible strings for screen readers
